## What was delivered

Six user stories across 103 tasks. The corpus becomes citable chunks through
one committed page reader and a three-class boundary ladder; every extracted
value carries the page it was printed on; an untrustworthy value is absent
rather than wrong; a value split across a page break keeps both pages; every
value names the run that produced it; and re-ingesting is safe, skipping
documents whose per-document input tuple is unchanged.

Five migrations in block 0400-0499, chaining from E007's head at 0303.
Zero columns, constraints or indexes were added to the six E003-owned tables,
and their catalog entries are asserted identical at 0303 and at head.

The pipeline runs from the `ingest` console entry. On a clean database it
wrote 6,391 chunks across the 26 real specifications, then aborted on the
first synthetic transmittal with `fixture_missing`, leaving 24 `not_reached`.
A second run skipped all 26 as unchanged. Both outcomes are the designed
behaviour and are published by the disposition ledger rather than inferred.

